{
  "author": "Portal Suite",
  "content": "<section style=\"margin:0 0 22px;padding:18px 16px;border-left:5px solid #C9A227;background:#F7F3E8\"><p style=\"margin:0 0 8px;color:#7A5B12;font-size:14px;font-weight:700\">Portal Suite</p><p style=\"margin:0;color:#142033;font-size:21px;font-weight:700;line-height:1.4\">摩根大通：奇鋐科技2Q26毛利率低于预期，3Q26营收增长改善</p></section>\n<p style=\"margin:10px 0;line-height:1.78;color:#202631;font-size:16px\">这份<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700\">JPM</span>研究笔记的核心判断并不复杂：Auras Technology（奇鋐科技）<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">二季度</span>毛利率<span style=\"color:#B26B00;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">低于预期</span>，但<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">三季度</span>营收会因GB300冷板订单补发而明显<span style=\"color:#2F8F5B;font-weight:700\">回升</span>，<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">四季度</span>则有AWS Trainium 3液冷产品首次贡献。真正让报告保持公司观点的原因，是公司在英伟达下一代VR冷板和ASIC液冷项目上的份额可能落后于一线同行。</p>\n<p style=\"margin:10px 0;line-height:1.78;color:#202631;font-size:16px\">先看数字。Auras二季度EPS为新台币10.4元，环比下降<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">17%</span>，同比大增<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">495%</span>，但比<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700\">JPM</span>和一致预期低<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">20%</span>。毛利率<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">28.4%</span>，低于上季度的<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">29.7%</span>，也低于<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700\">JPM</span>预期的29.9%和市场一致预期的29.3%。报告给出的解释是，GB300冷板出货在过渡期增长有限，液冷收入占比维持在55%，与一季度持平；同时新产品生产报废带来1-2个百分点的谨慎影响。营业费用率12.4%高于一致预期的11.3%，因为收入环比只增长2%，经营杠杆没有释放。</p>\n<p style=\"margin:14px 0;text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/YBsHov7VYOWxeibMx9l5bibiadT0icSic5aeRMibbth7NslOZvz6nJCBWTyUSib7ICd9nkZ3Tia0cnyXGhxPlsKVfOZmQrwo4UVtTcDrCVfSWAXotd0/0?from=appmsg\" alt=\"研报原图 1\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;display:block;margin:0 auto\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\"></p>\n<p style=\"margin:14px 0;text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/YBsHov7VYOX28YVl0RvvNlSSgNSk85UdlIDn3v384nWDTADtLdk1udwu2BQibxuibFx0upGEcr9wHWVkFGaGpzc0ZlIiaXK5542n8mOBVIgW6k/0?from=appmsg\" alt=\"研报原图 2\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;display:block;margin:0 auto\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\"></p>\n<p style=\"margin:14px 0;text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/YBsHov7VYOWpEtzMTbIOvZuIheWcDXh0Z60aAzE1FHw3kFA8T8XzYmgqfQ5uxJVvnJ35kMibR0ibjlPK4iaic3ksguIB35mIh9tQTZicytxGPcibU/0?from=appmsg\" alt=\"研报原图 3\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;display:block;margin:0 auto\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\"></p>\n<p style=\"margin:10px 0;line-height:1.78;color:#202631;font-size:16px\">这里更值得关注的是毛利率下滑的性质。它不是需求问题，而是产品切换期的暂时现象。GB300冷板订单从6月推迟到7月，7月营收新台币<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">38亿元</span>，环比增长<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">39%</span>、同比增长<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">117%</span>，其中约<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">3亿元</span>来自延迟订单的补发。报告据此把<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">三季度</span>营收预测上调到<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">103亿元</span>，环比增长<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">18%</span>、同比增长73%。四季度营收预计环比再增1.5%，同比增长37%，驱动力是AWS Trainium 3液冷订单的初始贡献，包括冷板模块、内部分歧管和机架分歧管等。</p>\n<section style=\"margin:18px 0;padding:13px 15px;background:#F1F8F4;border-left:4px solid #2F8F5B;color:#223044;font-size:15px;line-height:1.75\"><strong>KC评论：</strong> 先看7月营收环比增长<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">39%</span>这个数字，它说明GB300订单只是延迟而非消失。简单说，<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">二季度</span>毛利率走低是产品切换期的成本扰动，不是需求端出了问题；我更关注的是<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">三季度</span>液冷收入占比能否从<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">55%</span>升到<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">60%</span>以上，那才是毛利率回到30%的关键验证。</section>\n<p style=\"margin:10px 0;line-height:1.78;color:#202631;font-size:16px\">毛利率的恢复路径在报告里写得很清楚。<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700\">JPM</span>预测<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">三季度</span>毛利率<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">30.4%</span>，四季度<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">30.6%</span>，全年<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">29.9%</span>。支撑逻辑是液冷收入占比从<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">三季度</span>的<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">55%</span>提升到60%以上，产品结构改善抵消新产品的爬坡成本。2026和2027年EPS预测分别上调4%和16%，至新台币54.36元和67.15元，但两个数字仍比彭博一致预期低4%和11%。差距的来源是JPM对公司在英伟达VR200和ASIC项目上的市场份额假设更保守。</p>\n<p style=\"margin:10px 0;line-height:1.78;color:#202631;font-size:16px\">把这件事拆开看，Auras的短期增长故事其实很顺：GB300补单、Trainium 3放量、液冷占比提升，三个驱动因素都指向下半年营收和毛利率同步<span style=\"color:#2F8F5B;font-weight:700\">改善</span>。但报告更新公司观点，理由落在更长的维度上。研究论点部分写得很直接：公司未来的盈利增长潜力会被英伟达下一代VR冷板从<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">2026年</span>下半年开始的市场份额流失所限制；ASIC液冷渗透率提升虽然扩大了冷板市场的总盘子，但Auras在ASIC冷板市场的份额较小，未必能充分受益。</p>\n<p style=\"margin:10px 0;line-height:1.78;color:#202631;font-size:16px\">这里有一个值得<span style=\"color:#2F8F5B;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">注意</span>的对比。报告把<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">2027</span>年EPS预测上调了<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">16%</span>，但依然比一致预期低<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">11%</span>。</p>\n<p style=\"margin:28px 0 0;padding-top:12px;border-top:1px solid #D9DEE7;color:#8A93A3;font-size:12px;line-height:1.6\">For informational purposes only. Portions may be generated, translated, summarized, or edited with AI assistance based on source materials and may contain omissions or errors. Please verify independently. This is not investment, legal, tax, accounting, or other professional advice.</p>\n<p style=\"margin:14px 0;text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/YBsHov7VYOVUtpnKv3QGoaaGyg8WeMupXK8ahsGG250UpkAzmBRFG5fibxhMTruWqygv3Wfo2vqFsR5DOfMJiaLD0eMK22FLuOAryZalQwRF0/0?from=appmsg\" alt=\"Portal Suite\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;display:block;margin:0 auto\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\"></p>\n<p style=\"margin:16px 0 0;color:#A3ABB8;font-size:12px;line-height:1.55;text-align:left\">Original report: 32-JPM-Auras Technology-3324.TW-2Q26 GM a miss- better 3Q26 growth outlook driven by higher GB300 contribution-260810</p>\n<p style=\"margin:16px 0 0;padding:14px 16px;background:#EAF2FB;border-left:4px solid #2E6FB7;color:#152033;font-size:15px;line-height:1.75;font-weight:600\">更新信息参见portal.example.invalid</p>",
